===================== Version2.0.5 =====================
Version: 2.0.5
Date:    2026-08-26
Author:  xiaolong zhang
Email:   zhangxiaolong@big.ac.cn
Descrip:
    1. bundle the dependencies (zlib-ng and bzip2) into the project and build
       them from source, so no system library (zlib/libbz2) is needed
    2. migrate the build system from makefile to cmake, and the old makefile
       has been removed
    3. add a github action (release.yml) that builds fully static executables
       for linux amd64 and arm64 and publishes them as a github release

===================== Version2.0.6 (2026-09-01) =====================
### Features

- Added `version.h` as the single source of the version number;
  both the binary and the release workflow now read the version from it
- Made the codebase cross-platform (**Windows** / macOS / Linux): replaced the non-portable `%llu` / `%lld`
  format specifiers with the `PRIu64` / `PRId64` macros from `<inttypes.h>`
- Reworked the GitHub Actions release workflow to build Linux (amd64/arm64, fully static musl),
  macOS (amd64/arm64) and Windows (amd64/arm64) binaries in parallel and publish them as a GitHub release

### Bug Fixes

- Fixed the Linux arm64 release build: switched from the zig cross-compiler to native musl-gcc on GitHub's arm64 runner

